# Installation Instructions: CUDA Enterprise Batch Image Resampling Engine

Please refer to INSTALL.md for complete formatting and command listings.

Quick Start:
1. Verify CUDA and GPU:
   nvidia-smi
   nvcc --version

2. Build the executable:
   make clean
   make all

3. Generate datasets:
   make data

4. Run tests:
   make test

5. Run full benchmark:
   make benchmark
